    "test_usage": "final metrics only; never fit, never tuned, no early stopping",
    "pairing": "the head stack is trained ONCE at seed 0; all four reference methods and all 5 learned seeds are scored on the SAME test logits, so every row is paired",
    "parity_mechanism": "FusedFeaturizedJevX / collect_logits_and_fused / train_learned_confidence / evaluate_confidence are IMPORTED from benchmarks.run_exp6b (not re-typed), so the code objects executed here are the reference implementation's"
